// Karoryfer Lecolds libraries snare: snare drum (unpitched). Samples: Karoryfer Lecolds (Black And Green Guitars, Emily Guitar, Black And Blue Basses, D. Smolken double bass, Aliexpress Erhu, Swirly Drums), CC0 1.0 (https://github.com/sfzinstruments).
// Generated by scripts/make_karoryfer_library.py; sample paths are relative to the library's cache folder.
<control>
// volume: the median plain-velocity sample (loudest 400 ms) is -20 LUFS, its peak at most 0.7; dynamic layers keep their recorded levels.
<group> volume=13.5 ampeg_release=0.3 loop_mode=one_shot pitch_keytrack=0
